# Production worker configuration (set via `npx wrangler secret put` /
# Cloudflare dashboard, NOT a committed file).
#
# HYPERDRIVE binding "HYPERDRIVE" is declared in wrangler.jsonc (prod path).
# Required secrets: APP_SECRET (token unsealing), HEROKU_API_TOKEN
# (+ HEROKU_APP_NAME=mawzun) for the live DB-URL resolution fallback.
# Optional: DATABASE_SSL=1, DB_URL_TTL_MS.
# Inventory push batch size is a wrangler.jsonc var:
#   INVENTORY_PUSH_SKUS_PER_RUN (default 250).
